# The Vercel CLI is invoked from the monorepo root. Nested .gitignore files are
# not a sufficient secret boundary for that upload: without these root-level
# rules, app/.env was included in a preview source bundle even though Git
# ignored it. Vercel provides hosted environment variables separately.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Local CLI state and build/dependency output are never deployment source.
**/.vercel
**/node_modules
**/.next
macos/build
